{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"声音一边往高处攀，一边渐渐变轻，到后来才慢下来\",\"source\":\"音乐一边奋力向高处攀升，一边又渐渐收弱，并没有稳稳落下。到第34小节，摇晃渐渐放慢\",\"type\":\"8\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿中渐渐放慢的是摇晃感，屏幕稿改成声音本身慢下来，改变了具体发生变化的对象。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将肩膀松开、胸腔打开作为感受的比喻，屏幕稿去掉比喻标记并接入人物叙事，容易读成他实际发生了这一身体反应。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e07a420b-8806-4931-b625-5c5dc837ea02", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T213940442168Z", "elapsed_seconds": 162.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T21:42:22.990801+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0571d5fd0cd0a2f3d790f4fb8d3d904ae7a370b7d40cd31dd1232c5b90015433", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.